  s3 --> s4: owner identity cannot be established
  s3 --> s5: owner exits or its process identity changes
  s4 --> s0: lease holder releases the lease
  s4 --> s3: owner identity matches again
  s4 --> s5: owner exits or its process identity changes
  s5 --> s0: reconciliation removes a positively stale lease or lease holder releases the lease
  s6 --> s7: collection retires the reference root
  s7 --> s8: pressure collection reclaims eligible content
